sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 评价用户
    participant UI as 用户界面
    participant Service as ReviewService
    participant DAO as ReviewDAO
    participant DB as SQLite数据库

    User->>UI: 填写评分及评价内容
    UI->>Service: submitReview(review)

    Service->>Service: 校验评价信息
    Service->>DB: 检查流转状态及评价权限
    DB-->>Service: 返回检查结果

    alt 满足评价条件
        Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        Service->>DAO: insert(review)
        DAO->>DB: INSERT INTO review
        DB-->>DAO: 返回插入结果

        Service->>DB: 更新被评价用户信用分
        DB-->>Service: 返回更新结果
        Service->>DB: COMMIT

        Service-->>UI: 返回评价成功
        UI-->>User: 显示评价成功信息
    else 不满足评价条件
        Service-->>UI: 返回校验失败信息
        UI-->>User: 提示无法提交评价
    end
